    "white/solid_pea_coat.jpg"
   ]
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 19,
   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:13",
   "text": "Understood. The second one's garment type goes on the no list.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 20,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:14",
   "text": "She also sent this: I've tried this garment type in three different versions. None of them worked.",
