   "speaker": "assistant",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:15",
   "text": "Same garment type, many versions, same result. It's out.",
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "turn_id": 22,
   "speaker": "user",
   "time": "2026-07-10 19:16",
   "text": "Next out of the box: These two are unalike in every way but one pattern — the pattern I keep away from.",
